[{"client_msg_id":"91ecf25b-b31f-4ffe-8cb9-8adb6657bfd6","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"monaqa さんがすでに同じことを書いていた。。。","ts":"1616337376.073700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xSg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"01e9b61a-13dd-42ed-9b8f-93ba70545c2b","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"遅レスですが「遊んでもらう」は「遊んでいただく」みたいなニュアンスで捉える感じになりそうですね。","ts":"1616337353.073400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"obe"}]},{"client_msg_id":"540156da-b3be-4915-a65c-7a35125c2667","type":"message","user":"U01EMNN9XNG","text":"皆さん、ありがとうございます","ts":"1616312792.072600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"IM2N"}]},{"client_msg_id":"047b7b06-7dc1-4578-97d6-63e30a75cd3f","type":"message","user":"U01EMNN9XNG","text":"確かに、なるほど","ts":"1616312539.072000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vncf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e16e8ceb-6e98-4827-ae41-0b0f423a8da5","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"元の文章だと、いろいろニュアンスが取れそうですが\n妹は兄に遠慮していることを表現するために \"もらう\" を付けてるみたいなパターンもありえそうですね","ts":"1616312244.071700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"joD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4bbda55f-b824-4008-9ea0-2ea8bdf626b0","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"恐怖を感じるかどうかはそうですね \u0026gt; 関係性に依存\nというより日本語の強制力は忖度によって決まる面が大きい気もしますね...","ts":"1616311535.065200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Jm+qt"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bc4a3204-4b36-404a-a924-a90471588b29","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"うーむ。私が have のニュアンスを取り違えている可能性が高い気がしてきたぞ…","ts":"1616311533.065100","thread_ts":"1616311533.065100","reply_count":3,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Xlv/d"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f4549e80-ec11-4f91-8866-3da1d6467f56","type":"message","user":"U01EMNN9XNG","text":"逆に家族と使わないかも？うーん難しい…","ts":"1616311447.063100","edited":{"user":"U01EMNN9XNG","ts":"1616311474.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"g63Io"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1b40ddec-70f3-4ada-91a5-60548eda8c93","type":"message","user":"U01EMNN9XNG","text":"生徒が悪いことした時先生に言われるかも","ts":"1616311404.062200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xOj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"88fdb61b-9480-470c-905a-80740e89a995","type":"message","user":"U01EMNN9XNG","text":"have めっちゃしっくりきますね. I'll have you come with meはかなりの強制","ts":"1616311389.061900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Nb19D"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9C2FA67F-A2E5-4DB5-BA23-5890FA4275EE","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"強制は含みますがそれに恐怖は感じないですよね。\nだから、言葉に左右されるものではなく、その人との関係性などの外部的な要因にされる\n\nと言うことを言いたかった","ts":"1616311294.059700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vuHr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"81abe422-a9a6-4cd8-8145-740c45f6e48b","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"let, have, make でいうところの have ぐらいかと思ってました。","ts":"1616311268.058500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7wz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"90196f71-503b-420d-99da-414a79fd5b2f","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"弱い強制の意味は含む気がしますね \u0026gt; もらう\nlet くらい? それより弱いかも?","ts":"1616311200.055900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0S3N"}]},{"client_msg_id":"C2A0D7E7-9557-43C6-B469-C4F761A07BC7","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"上からなのはそうですが、それに恐怖を感じるかと言われればそうではない（距離感が近いから）","ts":"1616311100.054700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4s6+W"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5949dd44-dd51-4be5-9468-548b743822c0","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"これ思い出した\n\u003chttps://twitter.com/sneg_nebo_9105/status/1372287533086740480\u003e","ts":"1616311066.053400","attachments":[{"fallback":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/sneg_nebo_9105|@sneg_nebo_9105\u003e: このコメント見ながら無限に笑ってる \u003chttps://pbs.twimg.com/media/EwtYPOKUUAAVppC.jpg\u003e","id":1,"author_name":"neige ciel 9105","author_subname":"@sneg_nebo_9105","author_link":"https://twitter.com/sneg_nebo_9105/status/1372287533086740480","author_icon":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1287000862015938560/wBmnCAZ2_normal.jpg","text":"このコメント見ながら無限に笑ってる \u003chttps://pbs.twimg.com/media/EwtYPOKUUAAVppC.jpg\u003e","image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/EwtYPOKUUAAVppC.jpg","blocks":null,"footer":"Twitter","footer_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/services/twitter_pixel_snapped_32.png","ts":1616013818,"service_name":"twitter","from_url":"https://twitter.com/sneg_nebo_9105/status/1372287533086740480","original_url":"https://twitter.com/sneg_nebo_9105/status/1372287533086740480"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"warau","count":1,"users":["U01ATUT6PL3"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Tjheb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1BBF4E9E-AD73-4560-B424-FD44D1A095B6","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"例えば、素直になれない妹や、自分の親に、\n「今日は買い物に付き合ってもらうよ」と言われても脅迫に感じたりとかないですよね。","ts":"1616311049.052900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"43a0d"}]},{"client_msg_id":"FAD6B29B-B069-47AE-BA51-952D563F805E","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"どちらかと言うと、ヤクザの場面の印象は言葉にいぞんしないですね。見た目や態度声のトーンなどで判断する感じ","ts":"1616310980.050600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1xwV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7e652e24-2a2f-428b-90d5-d79a6d54a15f","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"「お嬢さんかわいいね」をヤクザが言うと恐ろしい","ts":"1616310933.048900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hiee","count":3,"users":["U01BY3SDBRS","UL6CFN8NR","U01AQ5BFNLX"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"g0t"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9b790f0c-d4b7-4c1d-9acf-da11dbeab623","type":"message","user":"U01EMNN9XNG","text":"でもそういうことですね…","ts":"1616310890.047300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"d8fM3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"65729185-6d96-41d8-bb78-be2cb4a695b5","type":"message","user":"U01EMNN9XNG","text":"「ヤクザ」と言う言葉を敢えて誤魔化そうとしてましたｗ","ts":"1616310882.047100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FwZ6i"}]},{"client_msg_id":"779388e2-62cc-4fe1-b757-2e5a20455edc","type":"message","user":"U01EMNN9XNG","text":"そうですね","ts":"1616310846.046300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"SIO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cd70a332-0ff7-4d2b-bf8e-a735b8bea6d5","type":"message","user":"U01EMNN9XNG","text":"なるほど、そうですね。どの映画/アニメかははっきり覚えてないんですけど、ある人が「ちょっと付き合ってもらうよ、兄さん」みたいな言い方されて、有無を言わさずに数人の男性に無理やり連れ去られ、ボコボコにされた場面があったのでそういう印象持ってたかも知れません","ts":"1616310800.045900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"OuQE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1bce6a47-d9b8-4368-9b02-241df9306ad6","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"たしかに映画などで強面の人が「ちょっと面貸してもらおうか、兄ちゃん」みたいな言い回しすることもありますが、まあヤクザな人が言えばだいたいどんな言葉でも脅迫になるもんです :sunglasses:\n妹さんがカタギの人であれば、よほど強面でないかぎり脅迫っぽいニュアンスは出てこないと思います","ts":"1616310795.045800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U01EMNN9XNG"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mIY1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0965cb80-192b-4479-9022-f07431e6b430","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"脅迫的なイメージはあまりないですね。\n「〜してもらってもいい？」は「〜していただいてもいいですか？」「〜していただけませんか？」をよりフランクにした言い方です。\n家族や友達など、敬語を使うほどでもない相手には「〜してもらってもいい？」みたいな言い方をすることがあります。「〜してくれる？」「〜してくれない？」とほぼ同じですね。\n英語でいうと \"Can you ...?\" や \"Will you ...?\" ですかね。","ts":"1616310100.041400","edited":{"user":"UL6CFN8NR","ts":"1616310179.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xNn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"96f3381b-e306-495a-988f-19cccfc1011e","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"口語というかなんというか","ts":"1616309882.038600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0DDr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"29f2e565-5bf6-40b4-a835-309c68cf81e8","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"あー、年の差とかはそうですねー。断片だったのでむしろ文学的表現の一環かと思ってしまった。\n純粋に口語ならそうなるな","ts":"1616309723.036800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Vkuh0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"28650f4d-5452-4470-9064-5338788aa2f7","type":"message","user":"U01EMNN9XNG","text":"他の映画などの脅迫的な言い方、例: 「お前に付きあってもらうぞ！！」みたいな言い方もあるのでちょっと困惑してました","ts":"1616309718.036500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4HBY/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6e4db54d-ebab-4d34-bbcb-f584d847ee61","type":"message","user":"U01EMNN9XNG","text":"あ、なるほど！詳しい説明ありがとうございます","ts":"1616309663.034200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"11d7k"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6481496e-bc3c-4a72-8452-2d92769cd27f","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"AとBが友達同士とかだったら「AがBと遊ぶ」でいいんですよ。「（Aが）Bに遊んでもらう」って言うと、A は B より年下なのかな、BはAよりも目上の人なのかな、といったニュアンスが生じる気がします。\n子供に対して「今日は叔父さんと遊んでもらいなさい」と言うとか。","ts":"1616309582.033800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yfn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9f6754cd-e4dd-4a22-9706-f64212e73494","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"ふーむ、なるほど。それだったら割と自然かも？\nもし「ある人」と「知り合った二人」が立場的に対等なら、「お二人に遊んでもらうのもいい」よりも「お二人と一緒に遊ぶのもいい」のほうが自然だと思ったんですが。\n「ある人」が「知り合った二人」よりも年下で先輩後輩の関係にあるなら、「〜してもらう」という言い方もおかしくはない気がしてきましたね。","ts":"1616309109.028700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U01EMNN9XNG"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8BN1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"29b42e17-e4a0-46b4-9c64-e2f36ab89d56","type":"message","user":"U01EMNN9XNG","text":"（兄の高校は別の街にあるので、一緒に住んでいないんです）","ts":"1616309068.028000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"KYv4H"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ce2c58ed-e244-4ec3-b9a1-9244a11ed1b9","type":"message","user":"U01EMNN9XNG","text":"ちょっと複雑ですので別の状況に当てはめようとしたんですが…実際こういう場面です:\n• 高校生の兄が心配で妹が見舞いに来る\n• そこで、その兄の友達二人と会う。二人が付き合っている\n• 妹がその二人と会話して、その二人に好印象を受けます\n• ほとんどの時間を兄と過ごす予定ですが、この二人とも過ごしたい？\nみたいなシチュエーションです","ts":"1616308968.026000","edited":{"user":"U01EMNN9XNG","ts":"1616309011.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CzlC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cb3c0044-1b6c-408e-b0e0-0904241020b9","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"これもちょっと説明としてはあいまいでむずかしいな","ts":"1616308954.025500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nz4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6190346a-7d9d-45ef-b7cc-7d4ae45760f9","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"もらう、だけに着目すると、このもらうは「遊ぶことを自分とともにして、もらう」のもらうなので、かわってるけど変じゃないくらいの用法かなあ?","ts":"1616308928.024600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"e7UyR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"45893bf1-a495-4408-87b3-647d7837b43e","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"うーん。細かいシチュエーションがよく分かってないですが。\nある人 + 知り合った二人は観光中で、「私はその二人と一日限りで一緒に観光したい」という旨を伝えようとしている、みたいな場面ですか？","ts":"1616308449.019000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1opzs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"95666acf-36b7-4bfb-975c-9e79d0aff2fd","type":"message","user":"U01EMNN9XNG","text":"ある人が用件である町に数日間滞在することになります。そこで、たまたま人二人と知り合う。そこで「一日ぐらい、おふたりに遊んでもらうのもいいかなと今、思いました」ということをその二人に伝える。\n\nこの文章ってどういう意味ですか？特に「もらう」の用法が少し変かなと思いましたけど、この用法でもOKですか？「もらう」は、「付き合ってもらうぞ」みたいな脅迫的なイメージがあるので知り合ったばっかりの人とでも使えますか？","ts":"1616308224.017000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kQJJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cd70002b-cd3b-4754-b7dc-89acc09aef53","type":"message","user":"U01EMNN9XNG","text":"\u003chttps://www.merriam-webster.com/dictionary/have\u003e\n\n7aの用法ですね、この場合","ts":"1616311930.069000","thread_ts":"1616311533.065100","attachments":[{"fallback":"Definition of HAVE","id":1,"title":"Definition of HAVE","title_link":"https://www.merriam-webster.com/dictionary/have","text":"to hold or maintain as a possession, privilege, or entitlement; to hold in one's use, service, regard, or at one's disposal; to hold, include, or contain as a part or whole… See the full definition","thumb_url":"https://merriam-webster.com/assets/mw/static/social-media-share/mw-logo-245x245@1x.png","blocks":null,"service_name":"merriam-webster.com","service_icon":"https://www.merriam-webster.com/apple-touch-icon.png","thumb_width":245,"thumb_height":245,"from_url":"https://www.merriam-webster.com/dictionary/have","original_url":"https://www.merriam-webster.com/dictionary/have"}],"parent_user_id":"UL6CFN8NR","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LVoH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bf361a60-45fc-4039-a5ff-89f8411c1e2e","type":"message","user":"U01EMNN9XNG","text":"\"to cause or command to do something—used with the infinitive without _to\"_","ts":"1616311968.069300","thread_ts":"1616311533.065100","parent_user_id":"UL6CFN8NR","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NdGy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9775c606-c269-4af5-9163-f17ae1b36b66","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"「何かをせよという命令を与えること、何かをする（せざるをえない）原因となること」…ということですかね。\nとなるとやはり私の have に対する理解が正しくなさそう。「〜してもらう」にそこまでの強制力を伴うニュアンスはないと思います。","ts":"1616312118.070600","thread_ts":"1616311533.065100","edited":{"user":"UL6CFN8NR","ts":"1616312171.000000"},"parent_user_id":"UL6CFN8NR","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U01EMNN9XNG"]},{"name":"desune","count":1,"users":["U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"oJR"}]}]
